### Get the first 5 books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?page=0&size=5

### Get the next 5 books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?page=1&size=5

### Get 10 books per page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?page=0&size=10


### Test pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?page=0&size=5&sort=price,asc


### Test with one book per page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?page=0&size=5&sort=price,asc


### Test second page: one book per page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?page=1&size=1



### Cheapest books first
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?page=0&size=5&sortBy=price&direction=asc

### Most expensive books first
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?page=0&size=5&sortBy=price&direction=desc

